<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπραγμ-άτευτος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[μᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impracticable,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις ἀ.,</span> i.e. an
			<i>impregnable</i> city, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.75.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deprived of commerce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακλεισθέντες.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>costing no trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i> B <i><span class="en">
				p.105
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.504
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>free from trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>inexperienced</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				39.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>not elaborate, simple, Vit.Aesch.</i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Is.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			; <i>without taking pains,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.191c
			</span></i>.</div>
